WEBVTT

01:30.230 --> 01:34.910
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.229 --> 01:37.780
[Episode 12]

01:38.590 --> 01:39.870
What I need to ensure is

01:40.350 --> 01:41.550
that every one of them

01:42.150 --> 01:43.840
must remain unharmed.

01:44.759 --> 01:45.759
Of course.

01:49.310 --> 01:50.110
What's wrong?

01:50.120 --> 01:51.450
Did you find something?

01:51.680 --> 01:52.509
You two,

01:53.280 --> 01:53.880
come here.

01:54.950 --> 01:55.400
Who?

01:56.460 --> 01:57.680
Those two at the back,

01:58.229 --> 01:59.280
turn around.

01:59.960 --> 02:01.640
We're done for.

02:03.200 --> 02:03.760
It's those two?

02:03.760 --> 02:04.430
Those two?

02:08.190 --> 02:09.120
We meet again.

02:11.080 --> 02:12.610
I spared your lives before.

02:12.840 --> 02:14.770
Can't believe you sneaked in here.

02:15.020 --> 02:16.710
Are you in a hurry to die?

02:17.150 --> 02:18.350
Has Hong Ye been here?

02:18.870 --> 02:19.840
Of course he has.

02:20.590 --> 02:21.630
Where is he now?

02:22.240 --> 02:24.750
In the flower sea you just walked through.

02:26.320 --> 02:27.550
Didn't you see him?

02:28.910 --> 02:29.680
No.

02:30.110 --> 02:32.890
He's probably already been composted
as fertilizer,

02:32.890 --> 02:35.420
returning to the soil
to nourish the flowers.

02:36.400 --> 02:37.240
Nonsense!

02:37.240 --> 02:38.030
All of you!

02:43.230 --> 02:45.890
My demon-slaying blade
only slays evil demons,

02:46.000 --> 02:47.760
yet it hasn't left its sheath.

02:48.630 --> 02:50.490
This proves you ladies are human,

02:50.680 --> 02:51.360
not demons.

02:52.720 --> 02:55.650
I believe you've merely strayed
from the right path.

02:56.360 --> 02:58.290
If you're willing to turn back now,

02:59.190 --> 03:00.490
there may still be hope.

03:00.490 --> 03:02.400
I'm already in the immortal realm,

03:02.400 --> 03:04.000
what is there to turn back to?

03:04.050 --> 03:07.110
Return to the suffering
and torment of the human realm?

03:09.520 --> 03:11.470
Do you realize that
throughout this journey,

03:11.470 --> 03:12.800
everything you've seen

03:13.170 --> 03:14.700
is nothing but an illusion?

03:18.150 --> 03:19.910
All this is created by that spirit,

03:19.910 --> 03:21.840
manifested from selfish desires.

03:21.910 --> 03:23.850
This place is her realm of fantasy.

03:25.610 --> 03:26.970
What you see before you

03:27.610 --> 03:28.940
is not real!

03:31.520 --> 03:32.630
How can this be?

03:34.230 --> 03:35.470
Is this real?

03:35.020 --> 03:36.950
[Content with Simple Fare]

03:44.990 --> 03:45.600
Tan'er,

03:46.690 --> 03:48.700
reveal this place's true form.

04:14.160 --> 04:16.910
[Content with Simple Fare]

04:24.850 --> 04:28.680
[Content with Simple Fare]

04:26.590 --> 04:27.720
That's impossible.

04:29.760 --> 04:31.040
What trick did you use?

04:32.070 --> 04:33.290
The one who used tricks

04:33.290 --> 04:35.020
was your Dreamshard Immortal.

04:35.390 --> 04:37.320
I only broke through her illusion.

04:43.070 --> 04:44.590
Tell me where Hong Ye is.

04:44.830 --> 04:45.760
He did come here.

04:46.790 --> 04:48.380
But none of us saw him.

04:48.500 --> 04:50.750
Immortal Lord dealt with him personally.

04:50.750 --> 04:51.409
After that,

04:51.690 --> 04:53.290
we heard nothing more of him.

04:53.630 --> 04:54.470
I suppose...

04:55.060 --> 04:56.630
he's been dealt with by the Immortal.

04:56.630 --> 04:57.430
Impossible!

04:57.450 --> 04:58.510
His Lordship is the Demon King.

04:58.510 --> 05:00.040
He couldn't possibly lose to her.

05:00.040 --> 05:02.300
Take us to find the Dreamshard Immortal.

05:03.040 --> 05:04.270
What kind of hellish place is this?

05:04.270 --> 05:05.390
I don't want to stay here a moment longer.

05:04.780 --> 05:08.800
[Content with Simple Fare]

05:05.590 --> 05:06.340
Demon Slayer,

05:06.340 --> 05:07.870
take us back to the ship now.

05:10.000 --> 05:11.130
Now that we're here,

05:11.490 --> 05:13.440
we must find the spirit before we leave.

05:13.440 --> 05:15.240
I don't care. I want to leave now.

05:15.360 --> 05:15.960
Everyone!

05:17.420 --> 05:20.190
His Majesty went to great lengths
to lure out the spirit.

05:20.190 --> 05:22.190
Now the main culprit is right before us.

05:22.190 --> 05:24.240
We must prioritize what's important.

05:24.240 --> 05:25.040
Rest assured,

05:25.240 --> 05:26.190
once we slay the spirit,

05:26.190 --> 05:27.310
I'll take you all home.

05:27.310 --> 05:29.190
So what if you find Immortal Lord?

05:31.160 --> 05:32.950
You're no match for her.

05:33.190 --> 05:33.630
That's right.

05:33.630 --> 05:34.070
Exactly.

05:34.070 --> 05:35.120
Take us back first.

05:35.120 --> 05:36.360
Please take us back.

05:37.270 --> 05:38.800
Take us back first, please.

05:39.360 --> 05:40.159
Lu Tong.

05:43.920 --> 05:44.780
Do you know him?

05:47.070 --> 05:48.040
Who?

05:58.870 --> 06:00.240
Lu was my senior.

06:01.560 --> 06:02.630
Also a Feiyu Guard.

06:04.230 --> 06:07.230
We faced near-death situations together
many times.

06:08.070 --> 06:09.190
Lu once told me

06:10.390 --> 06:11.360
he had a sister.

06:13.650 --> 06:14.610
She was captured

06:15.990 --> 06:17.590
by a demon when she was young.

06:19.890 --> 06:21.410
Lu joined

06:21.860 --> 06:23.460
the Feiyu Guard for revenge.

06:25.030 --> 06:27.160
He vowed to slay demons as his mission.

06:29.830 --> 06:31.190
I remember his sister

06:33.070 --> 06:34.680
was also named Lu Pianpian.

06:36.950 --> 06:37.870
Who?

06:40.000 --> 06:41.600
She's also called Pianpian?

06:44.750 --> 06:45.510
Lu Pianpian.

06:47.120 --> 06:49.190
You were abducted
by a demon when you were young,

06:49.190 --> 06:51.120
but you still remember your name.

06:51.740 --> 06:52.750
Do you remember

06:53.920 --> 06:55.680
having such a brother?

07:00.310 --> 07:01.160
Lu Tong...

07:07.750 --> 07:08.870
Where is he now?

07:09.210 --> 07:10.670
Take me to slay the spirit,

07:11.510 --> 07:13.040
and I'll take you to see him.

07:14.560 --> 07:15.510
Sir.

07:16.600 --> 07:17.730
I'll take you there.

07:19.510 --> 07:20.480
Exalted Immortal...

07:20.480 --> 07:22.040
You're the true Exalted Immortal,
aren't you?

07:22.040 --> 07:23.920
I was blinded by the Dreamshard Immortal,

07:23.920 --> 07:25.050
which led me astray.

07:25.390 --> 07:26.160
Exalted Immortal,

07:26.160 --> 07:27.560
I'll take you to find her.

07:27.630 --> 07:29.040
You can definitely defeat

07:29.040 --> 07:30.100
and eliminate her.

07:32.800 --> 07:34.260
Please lead the way, miss.

07:35.130 --> 07:36.820
[Content with Simple Fare]

07:44.720 --> 07:45.600
Be careful.

07:47.750 --> 07:48.830
With your skills,

07:50.480 --> 07:51.630
if you leave
the Realm of Mist and Void now,

07:51.630 --> 07:53.720
you might still have a chance to survive.

07:53.720 --> 07:55.650
Do you really have to go seek death?

07:58.510 --> 08:01.640
The duty of the Feiyu Guard
is to eliminate evil spirits.

08:01.750 --> 08:03.630
Now this spirit is within reach.

08:04.240 --> 08:06.700
No matter how powerful
her demonic power is,

08:06.720 --> 08:08.390
I will fight with all my might.

08:09.510 --> 08:10.640
Please lead the way.

08:19.210 --> 08:21.640
[Content with Simple Fare]

08:21.480 --> 08:22.680
Why are they leaving?

08:22.830 --> 08:23.560
I don't know,

08:23.630 --> 08:24.890
but I don't want to die.

08:26.830 --> 08:27.920
I want to go home.

08:27.330 --> 08:30.430
[Content with Simple Fare]

08:28.270 --> 08:30.120
Do you think they can win?

08:30.800 --> 08:31.380
Anyway,

08:31.430 --> 08:33.090
we'll side with whoever wins.

08:33.549 --> 08:35.880
My family has served through
many dynasties of Tiansheng Kingdom,

08:35.880 --> 08:37.690
always maintaining high positions

08:37.690 --> 08:39.710
by never choosing the wrong side.

09:45.020 --> 09:47.180
What an illusion.

10:35.890 --> 10:36.890
It's not working.

10:37.370 --> 10:38.620
This won't hurt her.

10:39.630 --> 10:41.960
I need to find a way
to reveal her true form.

10:44.050 --> 10:45.340
Stop these tricks!

10:45.550 --> 10:47.680
Please show yourself, Immortal Lord!

11:00.480 --> 11:01.510
Where is Hong Ye?

11:01.960 --> 11:04.820
You managed to sneak into
the Realm of Mist and Void—

11:05.000 --> 11:06.390
you have some skills.

11:08.550 --> 11:09.270
Pianpian.

11:10.300 --> 11:12.460
You led them here to deal with me?

11:14.000 --> 11:15.510
They were too arrogant.

11:15.510 --> 11:16.360
My powers are limited,

11:16.360 --> 11:17.690
I couldn't handle them,

11:17.910 --> 11:19.440
so I had to bring them to you.

11:19.990 --> 11:21.670
She's been acquainted
with that Feiyu Guard for a while,

11:21.670 --> 11:23.800
working together from inside and out.

11:26.320 --> 11:27.320
I know I was wrong,

11:27.480 --> 11:28.840
but I beg for your forgiveness.

11:28.840 --> 11:30.320
That blade is indeed powerful.

11:30.320 --> 11:31.550
I was threatened by them,

11:31.550 --> 11:32.750
I truly had no choice.

11:33.360 --> 11:34.400
But I know

11:34.480 --> 11:36.210
you can certainly subdue them.

11:41.990 --> 11:43.050
Let's fight.

11:45.670 --> 11:46.720
Whoever wins—

11:46.910 --> 11:49.390
the past can be forgotten.

12:03.790 --> 12:04.430
Run!

12:41.800 --> 12:42.680
Pianpian...

12:49.910 --> 12:50.510
Watch out!

13:32.490 --> 13:33.430
Pianpian.

13:39.120 --> 13:40.720
You're still soft-hearted.

13:43.770 --> 13:45.430
You want to fight me?

13:47.850 --> 13:49.610
And you want to see Hong Ye?

13:50.720 --> 13:51.270
Fine.

13:51.750 --> 13:53.240
I'll grant your wish.

14:09.150 --> 14:09.740
Hong Ye.

14:09.960 --> 14:10.600
My Lord.

14:11.630 --> 14:12.200
My Lord!

14:16.120 --> 14:17.250
He has lost his mind.

14:17.960 --> 14:19.760
You'd better stay away from him.

14:22.670 --> 14:23.240
Hong Ye.

14:23.520 --> 14:24.530
Look at me.

14:24.640 --> 14:25.520
I'm Xiao Yao.

14:55.750 --> 14:56.360
Tan'er!

15:03.520 --> 15:04.510
Hong Ye, no!

15:05.000 --> 15:05.550
Xiao Yao!

15:22.840 --> 15:23.480
Xiao Yao!

15:26.670 --> 15:27.360
Hong Ye!

15:28.000 --> 15:28.720
Don't!

15:48.200 --> 15:48.960
Hong Ye.

16:01.720 --> 16:02.490
Hong Ye.

16:21.500 --> 16:22.120
Hong Ye!

16:28.420 --> 16:29.580
Interesting.

16:30.320 --> 16:33.110
You still have the will to fight against
the Heart-Devouring Poison.

16:33.110 --> 16:33.800
Hong Ye.

16:39.510 --> 16:40.200
Hong Ye!

16:55.320 --> 16:56.120
Bingzhu.

16:57.240 --> 16:58.970
Since you're destined to live,

16:59.960 --> 17:01.440
as long as you serve me,

17:02.200 --> 17:03.600
I'll let you stay.

17:11.109 --> 17:13.589
As a proud Demon Slayer
of the Feiyu Guard,

17:14.640 --> 17:16.440
how could I surrender my dignity

17:16.920 --> 17:19.109
to a spirit like you just to save my life?

17:19.109 --> 17:19.790
Bingzhu!

17:28.790 --> 17:29.750
It was a joke.

17:30.340 --> 17:31.170
Pianpian.

17:44.050 --> 17:45.270
You know what to do?

17:53.370 --> 17:54.070
Tan'er!

18:02.140 --> 18:03.400
This Spiritual Poison

18:03.680 --> 18:05.080
will connect your senses

18:05.570 --> 18:07.510
to the soul bound to this blade.

18:08.590 --> 18:09.590
Her suffering

18:10.650 --> 18:12.470
will become yours.

18:29.040 --> 18:30.460
Only you two are left.

18:41.440 --> 18:43.240
Please take me in, Immortal Lord!

18:43.240 --> 18:44.100
Immortal Lord,

18:44.200 --> 18:45.960
I'm willing to serve you forever.

18:45.960 --> 18:46.530
I...

18:47.350 --> 18:48.750
I know how to grow flowers

18:48.790 --> 18:50.030
and mix pollen.

18:50.730 --> 18:52.420
Please accept me!

18:53.070 --> 18:53.680
Dali.

18:55.520 --> 18:56.270
And you?

19:02.690 --> 19:04.090
I beg you, Immortal Lord,

19:04.790 --> 19:06.900
to remove
the Heart-Devouring Poison from Hong Ye

19:06.900 --> 19:09.360
and let him return with me
to Demons' Valley.

19:09.750 --> 19:10.480
Why should I?

19:18.270 --> 19:19.880
Because I can help you

19:20.560 --> 19:22.760
find the fragments of the Kunlun Mirror

19:22.920 --> 19:24.450
and locate the Yuli Spring.

19:26.790 --> 19:28.450
You've got quite an attitude.

19:29.720 --> 19:30.440
Fine.

19:31.590 --> 19:33.910
Then you can undergo the trial with her.

19:34.310 --> 19:35.400
If you pass,

19:35.880 --> 19:37.480
I'll consider your request.

19:38.400 --> 19:39.070
You...

19:44.210 --> 19:46.950
[Content with Simple Fare]

19:45.030 --> 19:46.160
It has changed back.

19:46.310 --> 19:47.240
It changed back.

19:47.390 --> 19:48.360
It's back.

19:54.370 --> 19:55.400
They're back.

19:57.270 --> 19:59.260
I've seen countless groups like yours

19:59.260 --> 20:00.550
coming to the Realm of Mist and Void

20:00.550 --> 20:02.000
to challenge

20:02.480 --> 20:04.000
the Immortal Lord.

20:04.790 --> 20:06.190
But you're the first pair

20:07.330 --> 20:08.850
to actually survive.

20:10.680 --> 20:13.010
It's all thanks to Immortal Lord's mercy.

20:16.200 --> 20:16.920
Look.

20:17.680 --> 20:20.080
The reason you saw those illusions earlier

20:20.110 --> 20:22.320
was because a man entered our realm.

20:23.370 --> 20:25.900
All men are impure
and bring negative energy,

20:25.920 --> 20:27.550
disturbing the tranquility of this place.

20:27.290 --> 20:31.890
[Content with Simple Fare]

20:28.070 --> 20:28.750
Now,

20:29.160 --> 20:31.790
Dreamshard Immortal
has cleared away the impurity.

20:31.790 --> 20:33.190
The Realm of Mist and Void

20:33.240 --> 20:35.240
has returned to its original state.

20:35.440 --> 20:36.680
The Immortal Lord is wise.

20:36.680 --> 20:38.240
That Feiyu Guard overestimated himself.

20:38.240 --> 20:39.370
His death is no loss.

20:40.880 --> 20:43.410
Where are the two ladies
who were here before?

20:43.640 --> 20:44.200
Why?

20:45.110 --> 20:46.590
Do you wish to see them?

20:48.480 --> 20:49.150
Men

20:49.270 --> 20:51.830
are not worthy
to enter the Realm of Mist and Void.

20:51.830 --> 20:53.640
After experiencing this minor setback,

20:53.640 --> 20:55.110
you should better appreciate

20:55.110 --> 20:57.100
the wonders of this paradise.

20:57.270 --> 20:58.350
In our realm,

20:58.510 --> 21:00.070
only women are revered.

21:00.640 --> 21:02.160
As long as you remain here,

21:02.310 --> 21:04.580
women can achieve immortality

21:04.680 --> 21:05.960
and eternal youth.

21:10.880 --> 21:11.510
You,

21:12.710 --> 21:14.480
wait with them for the trial.

21:16.070 --> 21:16.590
Yes.

21:23.160 --> 21:23.850
Xiao Yao,

21:24.240 --> 21:24.970
stay behind.

21:26.030 --> 21:26.820
Keep up.

21:28.580 --> 21:30.470
[Content with Simple Fare]

21:30.040 --> 21:31.540
There's a good task

21:31.930 --> 21:33.680
reserved especially for you.

21:48.200 --> 21:49.460
Where's that old lady?

21:50.240 --> 21:51.160
What old lady?

21:51.550 --> 21:52.960
When we first arrived here,

21:52.960 --> 21:54.830
she was watering the flowers here.

21:54.830 --> 21:55.550
She wore a headscarf

21:55.550 --> 21:56.610
and had misty eyes.

21:56.830 --> 21:57.960
Her age

21:57.960 --> 21:59.620
is actually similar to yours.

21:59.880 --> 22:01.680
She got this cushy job
of watering flowers.

22:01.680 --> 22:02.510
Unfortunately,

22:02.510 --> 22:04.960
her fortune was thin
and her immortal blessings ran out.

22:04.960 --> 22:06.140
Now she can only

22:06.400 --> 22:08.200
protect the flowers from below.

22:10.160 --> 22:11.500
In our realm,

22:11.650 --> 22:13.050
the sunlight is intense.

22:13.110 --> 22:14.990
The flowers need constant watering

22:14.990 --> 22:16.440
to remain beautiful.

22:16.790 --> 22:19.510
You must water
this entire flower field daily

22:19.880 --> 22:21.010
before you can rest.

22:21.160 --> 22:21.970
Understand?

22:24.030 --> 22:25.690
Where are the watering tools?

22:37.880 --> 22:39.210
Where do I get the water?

22:39.270 --> 22:40.200
Five li ahead,

22:41.110 --> 22:42.970
there's a spring on the mountain.

23:52.850 --> 23:56.130
♪ Fear that the red thread that bound us,
the vows we engraved ♪

23:57.080 --> 24:00.380
♪ The "forever" we swore are
meant to miss their mark ♪

24:06.790 --> 24:10.210
♪ Afraid of the exchanged life and death,
the arrows blocking the way ♪

24:11.060 --> 24:15.370
♪ The chains that are hard to break,
hard to distinguish ♪

24:18.790 --> 24:21.020
♪ Perhaps it's all for nothing ♪

24:22.320 --> 24:24.580
♪ Love and hate are nothing more ♪

24:25.400 --> 24:29.870
♪ Than a scene we rush through ♪

24:33.020 --> 24:35.270
♪ Afraid of giving my true heart ♪

24:36.470 --> 24:38.690
♪ The obsession that rises like magpies ♪

24:41.250 --> 24:43.150
♪ Boiling hot ♪

24:47.890 --> 24:52.300
♪ You and I are like grass and trees
meeting in the depths of the clouds ♪

24:50.880 --> 24:52.340
This desperate situation

24:53.210 --> 24:57.440
♪ Like the red thread strung together,
hanging on a sharp sword ♪

24:53.510 --> 24:55.000
does nothing to me.

24:56.240 --> 24:56.990
Hong Ye.

24:57.070 --> 24:58.310
When I find a chance,

24:58.310 --> 24:59.590
I'll definitely rescue you.

24:58.570 --> 25:01.350
♪ Waiting for the heartbeat
to shatter time ♪

24:59.920 --> 25:01.450
The Universe is boundless.

25:01.920 --> 25:03.480
I borrow power from the Cosmos.

25:02.550 --> 25:03.830
♪ The chains of fate ♪

25:03.790 --> 25:05.070
Winds and clouds, carry my order.

25:04.850 --> 25:08.630
♪ Belong to us, in the blink of an eye,
it's 1,000 years ♪

25:05.070 --> 25:07.000
The dragon and serpent, take wing.

25:07.920 --> 25:08.880
One day,

25:08.880 --> 25:10.310
I'll blow up the Realm of Mist and Void.

25:09.530 --> 25:12.940
♪ You and I meet across mountains
and rivers, under the bright moon ♪

25:14.000 --> 25:15.460
♪ The obsession that rises like magpies ♪

25:16.620 --> 25:17.900
♪ Both flushing ♪

25:18.970 --> 25:22.420
♪ Waiting to walk hand in hand
through the chessboard of fate ♪

25:23.630 --> 25:28.550
♪ The carefree moments that belong to us ♪

25:30.110 --> 25:31.410
I haven't watered you yet.

25:30.920 --> 25:32.710
♪ Moments ♪

25:32.750 --> 25:34.810
But why do you already have dew on you?

25:38.680 --> 25:39.540
Did I water you?

25:41.360 --> 25:42.820
That demon-slaying blade

25:42.880 --> 25:45.540
is being constantly burned
by the Ghostly Fire.

25:46.110 --> 25:48.400
Bingzhu will feel the pain every moment.

25:48.880 --> 25:50.450
I believe in a few days,

25:50.830 --> 25:51.830
he will succumb.

25:53.110 --> 25:54.170
What about Hong Ye?

25:55.640 --> 25:57.790
That punch broke his bones
and tore his tendons.

25:57.790 --> 25:59.750
He's been sent back
to the dungeon to recover.

25:59.750 --> 26:01.830
But since planting
the Heart-Devouring Poison,

26:01.830 --> 26:03.090
it's been over a month.

26:03.110 --> 26:04.000
His heart

26:05.070 --> 26:07.240
has already been tightly wrapped
by venomous insects.

26:07.240 --> 26:08.510
Normally,

26:09.030 --> 26:10.430
he should be like a puppet

26:10.590 --> 26:11.720
at your service.

26:12.590 --> 26:13.450
But his heart

26:13.680 --> 26:15.030
still beats strongly,

26:15.790 --> 26:19.400
constantly trying to break free
from the venomous insects' grip.

26:19.400 --> 26:20.710
Such stubbornness

26:20.790 --> 26:22.720
will only harm himself and others.

26:23.720 --> 26:24.510
Pianpian.

26:25.030 --> 26:27.160
Leading Bingzhu to Linghua Palace,

26:27.830 --> 26:30.030
deep down, you were hoping he would win,

26:31.000 --> 26:31.730
weren't you?

26:33.550 --> 26:34.480
I wouldn't dare.

26:42.390 --> 26:43.940
The punishment on your face

26:44.160 --> 26:46.280
is because your beauty and abilities

26:46.350 --> 26:47.480
are exceptional,

26:48.350 --> 26:50.150
and I've protected you too well.

26:50.880 --> 26:53.540
You've never seen
the filth of the mortal world.

26:54.030 --> 26:55.300
Over time,

26:55.590 --> 26:57.480
others will become jealous.

26:58.110 --> 26:59.840
I understand your intentions.

27:00.590 --> 27:01.520
This punishment

27:02.680 --> 27:04.440
is what I deserve.

27:04.880 --> 27:06.540
In this Realm of Mist and Void,

27:07.350 --> 27:09.160
you and I are most compatible.

27:09.880 --> 27:12.000
As long as you truly commit yourself,

27:12.920 --> 27:14.580
I will give you the divine dew

27:14.750 --> 27:16.400
to restore your beauty.

27:17.240 --> 27:18.700
Thank you, Immortal Lord.

27:24.750 --> 27:25.810
This feels so nice.

27:28.750 --> 27:29.550
Stop looking.

27:29.960 --> 27:30.590
It's me.

27:36.240 --> 27:37.550
Why are you not moving?

27:37.750 --> 27:39.000
You've been watering flowers all day.

27:39.000 --> 27:40.660
Don't you know to water me too?

27:40.680 --> 27:41.340
Who are you?

27:42.590 --> 27:43.920
You don't recognize me?

27:45.920 --> 27:47.450
While I'm still conscious,

27:48.070 --> 27:49.400
I'll attach my consciousness

27:49.400 --> 27:50.930
to this straw bracelet.

27:51.850 --> 27:53.400
It will protect you.

27:54.750 --> 27:56.810
You're Hong Ye's primordial spirit?

27:57.900 --> 27:58.350
Yes.

27:58.640 --> 27:59.400
I'm a primordial spirit—

27:59.400 --> 28:00.720
the Demon Lord's.

28:02.150 --> 28:03.950
How dare you address me as "you"?

28:06.800 --> 28:08.130
What powers do you have?

28:09.110 --> 28:11.720
My six senses are one with my true self.

28:12.000 --> 28:13.720
Whatever he can do, I can too.

28:15.110 --> 28:16.910
Then conjure some silver for me.

28:17.350 --> 28:17.840
What?

28:18.400 --> 28:19.600
Conjure some silver?

28:20.310 --> 28:22.860
I'm your lifeline in times of danger.

28:23.550 --> 28:25.680
How could I waste my power so casually?

28:25.800 --> 28:28.640
♪ A thousand years have flowed by ♪

28:30.030 --> 28:32.200
♪ Turning into tears
that brim over my eyes ♪

28:33.670 --> 28:35.930
♪ And the moonlight to heal sorrow ♪

28:37.060 --> 28:39.910
♪ The sweetness of the world
always tastes like the first time ♪

28:37.880 --> 28:38.940
As long as I'm here,

28:39.200 --> 28:40.800
your life won't be in danger.

28:41.020 --> 28:44.010
♪ The joys and sorrows in my dreams ♪

28:41.830 --> 28:42.350
Mm...

28:45.250 --> 28:47.610
♪ Transformed into a farewell song,
stirring the soul ♪

28:48.940 --> 28:51.290
♪ And into wind and rain,
drifting and swirling ♪

28:51.350 --> 28:52.280
Don't be afraid.

28:52.410 --> 28:54.660
♪ The ship of fate
always faces the waves ♪

28:55.010 --> 28:55.640
I'm here.

28:55.930 --> 28:59.000
♪ From now on, someone will share
all my love and hatred ♪

29:00.000 --> 29:02.570
♪ Together, we explore
mountains and rivers with one heart ♪

29:03.360 --> 29:06.620
♪ From now on, someone will share
all my dreams and my drinks ♪

29:07.680 --> 29:09.760
♪ With an extra pair of eyes, we
admire the sun, moon, and stars together ♪

29:10.940 --> 29:14.290
♪ From now on, the moon fears waning,
the waves long for the returning tide ♪

29:15.190 --> 29:17.730
♪ I carry an extra touch of care
in my heart and on my brow ♪

29:18.420 --> 29:21.690
♪ From now on,
with reckless courage and mutual longing ♪

29:23.110 --> 29:28.690
♪ Giving up three lives of marriage
just for ♪

29:32.710 --> 29:34.050
♪ Our wishes ♪

29:37.750 --> 29:39.430
Keep your spirits up!

29:39.950 --> 29:41.480
You must water me every day.

29:41.790 --> 29:42.390
Every day,

29:42.430 --> 29:43.470
you must ensure

29:43.640 --> 29:45.270
I get at least two hours of sunlight.

29:45.270 --> 29:46.880
But not direct intense sunlight.

29:46.880 --> 29:48.540
And I can't be exposed to cold.

29:49.200 --> 29:49.800
Of course,

29:49.960 --> 29:51.890
I shouldn't be overheated either.

29:52.310 --> 29:52.930
Also,

29:53.030 --> 29:54.310
when I want to talk,

29:54.440 --> 29:55.640
you need to chat with me

29:55.640 --> 29:56.640
and make me happy.

29:56.790 --> 29:58.350
And when I don't want to talk,

29:58.350 --> 29:59.480
you mustn't make a sound

29:59.480 --> 30:00.610
or disturb my peace.

30:02.070 --> 30:04.210
Are you Hong Ye's primordial spirit?

30:04.440 --> 30:06.550
He doesn't have all these annoying habits
like you.

30:06.550 --> 30:07.480
Hey, you!

30:07.920 --> 30:08.270
I—

30:08.880 --> 30:09.680
I'll show you—

30:09.680 --> 30:10.790
What?

30:10.920 --> 30:12.880
I shall call you Little Leaf.

30:13.390 --> 30:14.320
No, no.

30:14.720 --> 30:16.350
That sounds like a girl's name.

30:16.350 --> 30:17.400
How could that suit me?

30:17.400 --> 30:19.110
But you're in my hands now,

30:19.110 --> 30:20.440
so you have to do as I say.

30:20.440 --> 30:21.590
Little Leaf.

30:21.920 --> 30:22.680
Little Leaf.

30:22.920 --> 30:23.650
Little Leaf.

30:24.350 --> 30:25.250
Do you agree?

30:26.270 --> 30:27.110
Do you agree?

30:27.510 --> 30:28.350
If you don't agree,

30:28.350 --> 30:29.720
I'll keep tickling you.

30:29.720 --> 30:30.960
Do you agree? Do you agree?

30:30.960 --> 30:31.620
Fine, fine.

30:31.920 --> 30:32.850
I agree, I agree.

30:33.350 --> 30:34.310
I am Little Leaf,

30:34.440 --> 30:35.040
happy now?

30:36.790 --> 30:38.120
Come back, Little Leaf.

31:41.480 --> 31:43.200
This tea is cool and sweet.

31:44.920 --> 31:45.990
If you drink it,

31:46.750 --> 31:48.880
all your pain will disappear.

31:50.350 --> 31:51.970
If you continue suffering like this,

31:51.970 --> 31:53.570
your sister will suffer too.

31:56.790 --> 31:58.300
Why not let yourself off

32:00.710 --> 32:02.240
and let your sister off too?

32:03.310 --> 32:04.550
Survive first.

32:06.140 --> 32:07.800
I would rather die

32:09.510 --> 32:11.240
than surrender my principles.

32:13.360 --> 32:14.510
Tan'er and I

32:16.030 --> 32:17.480
are surely of one mind.

32:32.430 --> 32:34.230
Tan'er transformed into a blade

32:37.360 --> 32:39.380
just so you could live.

32:47.400 --> 32:48.260
What about you?

32:49.980 --> 32:51.520
Your brother Lu Tong

32:52.130 --> 32:53.460
was a man of integrity.

32:55.050 --> 32:56.840
How could you willingly

32:57.350 --> 32:58.830
bow and scrape

32:59.640 --> 33:01.120
to serve a spirit?

33:01.160 --> 33:02.960
But my brother is already dead!

33:12.350 --> 33:13.280
I guessed right.

33:14.720 --> 33:16.450
When you mentioned my brother,

33:16.760 --> 33:18.040
I was still hoping...

33:18.790 --> 33:21.110
hoping I might see him again.

33:22.810 --> 33:24.420
Your brother

33:26.020 --> 33:27.480
died a hero.

33:31.430 --> 33:32.350
You were there?

33:32.510 --> 33:33.200
Yes.

33:34.420 --> 33:36.080
Then why are you still alive?

33:38.480 --> 33:40.220
His dying wish

33:42.090 --> 33:44.960
was for me to find you.

33:47.250 --> 33:48.750
Now you've found me,

33:51.480 --> 33:52.910
what can you even do?

33:53.070 --> 33:54.070
Save you...

33:55.550 --> 33:57.310
from this misery.

34:10.350 --> 34:11.460
You?

34:13.570 --> 34:15.230
You can barely save yourself.

34:15.230 --> 34:16.130
Dreamshard

34:17.560 --> 34:19.420
is only powerful in illusions.

34:20.250 --> 34:22.650
But she never dares
to reveal her true form.

34:23.840 --> 34:25.440
If we can find her weakness

34:25.440 --> 34:26.900
and capture her true form,

34:28.190 --> 34:29.510
we can defeat her.

34:36.070 --> 34:37.510
I'll go back and report

34:38.480 --> 34:40.710
everything you said to the Immortal Lord.

34:40.710 --> 34:43.230
I'm your only chance
to escape her control!

34:45.550 --> 34:48.360
Quickly tell me everything
about Dreamshard,

34:51.030 --> 34:54.190
I might find a way to break her magic.

34:56.040 --> 34:56.920
I previously

34:57.190 --> 34:58.800
heard from Xiao Yao

34:59.800 --> 35:02.480
that Dreamshard was trapped by love,

35:03.400 --> 35:05.060
abandoned her immortal path,

35:05.710 --> 35:07.000
and became a spirit.

35:08.110 --> 35:08.840
Is that true?

35:16.830 --> 35:20.360
Immortal Lord was an immortal
of the Realm of Exalted Immortal.

35:20.590 --> 35:21.810
A thousand years ago,

35:22.850 --> 35:25.510
she admired the human realm's
hustle and bustle

35:26.650 --> 35:27.980
and descended to earth,

35:28.830 --> 35:30.710
falling in love with a human man.

35:32.360 --> 35:33.090
Originally,

35:33.550 --> 35:35.880
she was willing to give up her immortality

35:36.150 --> 35:39.350
for a few decades of happiness with him
in the human realm.

35:39.510 --> 35:40.800
But that man was frail.

35:42.440 --> 35:43.280
Before long,

35:44.590 --> 35:46.520
he fell ill with a strange disease.

35:46.590 --> 35:50.050
No matter how Immortal Lord
tried to heal him, nothing worked.

35:51.360 --> 35:53.290
The physician they consulted said

35:54.590 --> 35:56.790
unless they obtained the Kunlun Mirror

35:57.030 --> 35:58.670
and went to the celestial mountain

35:58.670 --> 36:00.000
to find the Yuli Spring,

36:02.190 --> 36:04.630
even gods couldn't save him.

36:05.810 --> 36:08.540
Immortal Lord
went through countless hardships

36:09.230 --> 36:11.630
and actually assembled the Kunlun Mirror.

36:11.760 --> 36:14.820
But when she returned to the man's home
with the mirror,

36:17.200 --> 36:19.920
she was trapped
by an immortal-binding formation.

36:19.920 --> 36:21.580
The Kunlun Mirror was stolen,

36:21.900 --> 36:23.760
and the man never appeared again.

36:25.320 --> 36:26.110
It turned out

36:28.370 --> 36:30.910
the strange disease was just a trap.

36:32.280 --> 36:34.190
The purpose was to make
Immortal Lord work tirelessly

36:34.190 --> 36:35.190
to assemble the Kunlun Mirror,

36:35.190 --> 36:37.280
so they could the mirror
to gain favor with the human emperor

36:37.280 --> 36:40.140
to become the imperial son-in-law
and gain wealth.

36:40.670 --> 36:44.330
Immortal Lord's powers were dispersed
by the binding formation.

36:46.440 --> 36:47.550
In desperation,

36:50.000 --> 36:52.300
she recited the Heart-Burning Incantation,

36:52.300 --> 36:54.160
transforming her original heart

36:56.920 --> 36:59.000
into a crystal heart.

36:59.360 --> 37:01.490
She abandoned her immortal identity—

37:01.630 --> 37:03.090
changing from an immortal

37:03.960 --> 37:05.200
into a spirit.

37:06.010 --> 37:09.270
The immortal-binding formation
could no longer trap her.

37:10.940 --> 37:12.800
She broke through the formation,

37:13.320 --> 37:15.070
and ripped out the hearts...

37:18.100 --> 37:20.080
of that man's entire family.

37:27.110 --> 37:27.920
From then on,

37:31.030 --> 37:33.560
there was no place for her
in the Three Realms.

37:34.030 --> 37:36.290
She had to find this otherworldly island

37:36.300 --> 37:37.810
beyond the Three Realms

37:38.400 --> 37:40.130
and outside the five elements.

37:40.320 --> 37:41.250
But spirits

37:41.480 --> 37:43.630
need large amounts of human essence

37:44.000 --> 37:46.630
to maintain their demonic powers
and appearance.

37:46.630 --> 37:47.960
For thousands of years,

37:49.760 --> 37:50.880
countless humans

37:51.590 --> 37:53.760
have come seeking immortality.

37:55.590 --> 37:56.510
In reality, they were just

37:56.510 --> 37:58.770
fertilizer for Immortal Lord's garden.

38:02.590 --> 38:04.120
Penglang Celestial Island

38:04.920 --> 38:06.920
is nothing but Dreamshard's scheme

38:07.400 --> 38:09.590
to bewitch humans.

38:11.960 --> 38:14.590
Penglang and the Yuli Spring
do truly exist.

38:16.590 --> 38:18.250
Yet finding the Kunlun Mirror

38:19.150 --> 38:21.080
is an exceedingly difficult task.

38:21.510 --> 38:23.000
After becoming a spirit,

38:24.840 --> 38:28.770
Immortal Lord can only maintain her power
in the Realm of Mist and Void.

38:29.890 --> 38:31.620
Once the physical body leaves,

38:32.280 --> 38:33.800
it will quickly wither.

38:34.640 --> 38:37.070
Unless one drinks
from the true Yuli Spring,

38:37.070 --> 38:39.200
one cannot return to immortal status.

38:40.070 --> 38:41.400
For thousands of years,

38:41.400 --> 38:43.070
she has sent batch after batch
of disciples

38:43.070 --> 38:46.190
to find the Kunlun Mirror fragments,
all without success.

38:46.190 --> 38:47.050
Unexpectedly,

38:48.770 --> 38:50.550
the Demon King Hong Ye,
a hundred years ago,

38:50.550 --> 38:52.110
assembled the complete Kunlun Mirror,

38:52.110 --> 38:53.640
shocking the Three Realms.

38:54.070 --> 38:56.150
But to win a human princess's favor,

38:56.150 --> 38:57.680
he handed it over to humans.

38:59.960 --> 39:01.320
And lost his life too.

39:02.230 --> 39:03.490
A hundred years later,

39:04.110 --> 39:05.570
Hong Ye is about to awaken.

39:06.230 --> 39:08.710
Immortal Lord cast a spell
to enter the human emperor's dreams,

39:08.710 --> 39:11.190
ensuring continued conflict
between humans and demons.

39:11.190 --> 39:12.830
She also created a phantom

39:13.590 --> 39:15.990
to lure Hong Ye
to the Realm of Mist and Void.

39:16.000 --> 39:16.710
However,

39:19.280 --> 39:21.960
Hong Ye's karmic ties with humans
remained unresolved.

39:21.960 --> 39:23.490
Immortal Lord had no choice

39:23.760 --> 39:25.800
but to send us to bring Hong Ye here.

39:28.590 --> 39:30.880
So the story's so complicated.

39:40.840 --> 39:42.800
I've told you the entire truth

39:43.070 --> 39:45.070
so you'll give up this futile quest.

39:48.360 --> 39:49.690
For thousands of years,

39:51.190 --> 39:52.590
countless humans and demons

39:52.590 --> 39:54.440
have challenged Immortal Lord
in the Realm of Mist and Void,

39:54.440 --> 39:56.100
but none have ever succeeded.

39:56.760 --> 39:59.550
Don't blame Immortal Lord
for being ruthless either.

39:59.550 --> 40:02.080
The flowers in
the Realm of Mist and Void today

40:03.590 --> 40:05.150
are all nourished

40:05.150 --> 40:06.950
by human selfishness and greed.

40:14.440 --> 40:17.320
You keep talking about humans,

40:18.000 --> 40:18.960
humans...

40:22.400 --> 40:23.460
But what about you?

40:25.030 --> 40:26.190
Are you a human,

40:27.400 --> 40:28.510
a demon,

40:29.320 --> 40:30.760
or a spirit?

40:35.630 --> 40:37.760
I suffered greatly in the human realm.

40:39.510 --> 40:41.710
Fortunately, Immortal Lord took me in,

40:41.800 --> 40:43.400
allowing me to serve here.

40:45.800 --> 40:47.360
Is that really true?

40:52.440 --> 40:54.280
I've said all I can say.

40:58.440 --> 41:01.280
I'll beg Immortal Lord to give you
three more days.

41:02.400 --> 41:05.260
If you still insist on your course
after three days,

41:05.670 --> 41:08.330
I'll take it as
you volunteer to be a fertilizer.

41:17.280 --> 41:19.410
Tan'er will also be melted into a hoe,

41:20.350 --> 41:22.630
serving Immortal Lord in the flower fields
for eternity.
